!kanal/sablon/
!kanal/*.md
# episode folders of private channels (story series etc.) never go public: only the template and the sample
# channel's videos are tracked. A tracked file stays tracked; a new public sample needs `git add -f`.
videolar/*
!videolar/_sablon/
!videolar/oxygbio-*/
